    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the works in the E4C series' universe.This is a 15-player battle royale arena game where players select a hero and enhance their level by collecting various types of randomly spawned gems within the arena. Character levels increase attack radius and ultimately determine the victor. Featuring fast-paced combat, any player hit by an attack instantly dies and respawns at a random location after 5 seconds. Through repeated gameplay, players can unlock more elaborate weapon skins and new heroes.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the works in the E4C series' universe.This is a 15-player battle royale arena game where players select a hero and enhance their level by collecting various types of randomly spawned gems within the arena. Character levels increase attack radius and ultimately determine the victor. Featuring fast-paced combat, any player hit by an attack instantly dies and respawns at a random location after 5 seconds. Through repeated gameplay, players can unlock more elaborate weapon skins and new heroes.</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a leisure competitive game, fighting for crystals in the arena, getting bigger, defeating opponents. New heroes, new skills and new weapons, call your friends to fight together~",
